<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανθῶσαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτοδινιᾶσαι,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάνισος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος θυμιάματος,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανκόν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρόν,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάννας:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλεύς</span> (Ital.), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαννάται:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ λοξοὶ ὁδοί</span> (
			Tarent.
		); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάννατροι</span></b> ,
		Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάννεια</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάννιμα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνεια</span>
			, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανοί:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχναι,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανόν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτόν,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάνος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάσμα, μωρός, καὶ τυφλός,</span> Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανούς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη στρογγύλα,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βανύσει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωραίνει, ἐπιμαίνεται,</span>
		Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
